# ts-rs output. Committed so the frontend typechecks and builds without a Rust
# toolchain — the VPS deploy runs `cargo build --release`, which does not run the
# tests that write these files. Regenerate with `bun run gen:types`; never edit
# by hand.
#
# `linguist-generated` collapses these by default in GitHub diffs and keeps them
# out of language stats. Deliberately NOT marked `-diff`: the churn in this
# directory IS the API diff, and it should stay readable when expanded.
frontend/src/types/generated/** linguist-generated=true
